{"seq":4,"slug":"custom-tools","title":"自定义工具开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/custom-tools","wordCount":877,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"自定义工具开发\">自定义工具开发</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自定义工具是将领域特定能力封装为 Agent 可调用组件的过程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"好工具不止是-api-包装\">好工具不止是 API 包装</h3><ul>\n<li>一个好的工具需要处理输入验证、错误恢复、结果格式化和安全控制</li>\n<li>自定义工具的质量直接决定了 Agent 系统在特定领域的表现上限</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[需求分析]--&gt;B[接口设计]&#10;    B--&gt;C[Schema 定义]&#10;    C--&gt;D[核心实现]&#10;    D--&gt;E[错误处理]&#10;    E--&gt;F[测试验证]&#10;    F--&gt;G[描述优化]&#10;    G--&gt;H[集成部署]\">flowchart TD\n    A[需求分析]--&gt;B[接口设计]\n    B--&gt;C[Schema 定义]\n    C--&gt;D[核心实现]\n    D--&gt;E[错误处理]\n    E--&gt;F[测试验证]\n    F--&gt;G[描述优化]\n    G--&gt;H[集成部署]</pre><h3 id=\"六条设计原则\">六条设计原则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具设计原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>常见反模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一职责</td>\n<td>每个工具只做一件事</td>\n<td>一个工具包含多种操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>明确边界</td>\n<td>清晰定义输入输出</td>\n<td>接受自由文本输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全优先</td>\n<td>验证所有输入</td>\n<td>直接透传用户输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幂等设计</td>\n<td>重复调用无副作用</td>\n<td>无法安全重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息充分</td>\n<td>返回足够上下文</td>\n<td>只返回 success/fail</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速失败</td>\n<td>尽早检测错误</td>\n<td>超时后才报错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据库查询工具\">数据库查询工具</h2><p>构建一个安全的数据库查询工具需要处理多个关注点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SQL 注入防护</li>\n<li>查询超时</li>\n<li>结果格式化</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"多层防御结构\">多层防御结构</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防御层</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Schema 层</td>\n<td>验证参数类型（Zod）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务层</td>\n<td>验证 SQL 安全性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行层</td>\n<td>控制超时和结果大小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"sql-校验逻辑\">SQL 校验逻辑</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[SQL 输入]--&gt;B{SELECT 开头?}&#10;    B--&gt;|否|X[拒绝]&#10;    B--&gt;|是|C{含危险关键字?}&#10;    C--&gt;|是|X&#10;    C--&gt;|否|D{表在白名单?}&#10;    D--&gt;|否|X&#10;    D--&gt;|是|E[放行执行]\">flowchart TD\n    A[SQL 输入]--&gt;B{SELECT 开头?}\n    B--&gt;|否|X[拒绝]\n    B--&gt;|是|C{含危险关键字?}\n    C--&gt;|是|X\n    C--&gt;|否|D{表在白名单?}\n    D--&gt;|否|X\n    D--&gt;|是|E[放行执行]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const validateQuery = (sql) =&gt; {&#10;  const q = normalize(sql);&#10;  if (!isSelect(q)) {&#10;    return reject(&#39;只允许 SELECT&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  if (hasDanger(q)) {&#10;    return reject(&#39;禁止关键字&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  if (!allowed(q)) {&#10;    return reject(&#39;不允许访问表&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  return { valid: true };&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateQuery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sql</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> q</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> normalize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sql);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isSelect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'只允许 SELECT'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hasDanger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'禁止关键字'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">allowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'不允许访问表'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { valid: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>危险关键字包括 DROP/DELETE/UPDATE/INSERT/ALTER/TRUNCATE/EXEC</li>\n<li>表名通过 <code>FROM|JOIN</code> 正则提取后逐一对照白名单</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"结果限行与提示\">结果限行与提示</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无 LIMIT</td>\n<td>自动追加 <code>LIMIT maxRows</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果被截断</td>\n<td>附 hint：「请添加更精确的 WHERE 条件」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行失败</td>\n<td>返回错误 + 修改建议，而不是裸异常</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"api-集成工具\">API 集成工具</h2><p>将外部 API 封装为 Agent 工具时，需要处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>认证</li>\n<li>速率限制</li>\n<li>响应格式化</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"滑动窗口速率限制\">滑动窗口速率限制</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const checkRateLimit = () =&gt; {&#10;  const now = Date.now();&#10;  calls = inWindow(calls, now);&#10;  if (calls.length &gt;= maxCalls) {&#10;    return false;&#10;  }&#10;  calls.push(now);&#10;  return true;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkRateLimit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  calls </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inWindow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(calls, now);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (calls.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxCalls) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  calls.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(now);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"请求执行要点\">请求执行要点</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const res = await fetch(url, {&#10;  method,&#10;  headers: config.headers,&#10;  signal: AbortSignal.timeout(10000),&#10;});&#10;return toJson(res).slice(0, 5000);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> res</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(url, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  method,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  headers: config.headers,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  signal: AbortSignal.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> toJson</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(res).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>被限流</td>\n<td>返回 <code>retryAfter</code> 提示而非直接失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非 2xx 响应</td>\n<td>转成带状态码的错误 JSON</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应过大</td>\n<td>截断到合理长度（如 5000 字符），保护上下文窗口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"文件系统工具\">文件系统工具</h2><ul>\n<li>文件系统工具允许 Agent 读写文件</li>\n<li>但必须严格限制访问范围以防止安全问题</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"路径遍历防护\">路径遍历防护</h3><p>文件系统工具的安全核心是<strong>路径遍历防护</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通过 <code>resolve</code> 和 <code>relative</code> 确保所有访问都限制在配置的根目录内</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const isPathSafe = (filePath: string) =&gt; {&#10;  const resolved = resolve(rootDir, filePath);&#10;  const rel = relative(rootDir, resolved);&#10;  return !rel.startsWith(&#39;..&#39;);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isPathSafe</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">filePath</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> resolved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rootDir, filePath);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> relative</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rootDir, resolved);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">startsWith</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'..'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"read_file-的防护清单\">read_file 的防护清单</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防护项</th>\n<th>实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路径范围</td>\n<td><code>isPathSafe</code> 拒绝越界路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展名</td>\n<td>仅放行 <code>allowedExtensions</code> 中的类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件大小</td>\n<td>超过 <code>maxFileSize</code> 时要求指定行号范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行号切片</td>\n<td>支持 <code>startLine</code>/<code>endLine</code> 局部读取</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"list_directory-的限制\">list_directory 的限制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>限制项</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路径校验</td>\n<td>同样走 <code>isPathSafe</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归</td>\n<td>支持 <code>recursive</code> 递归列出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截断</td>\n<td>前 100 个条目，只返回名称与类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工具测试策略\">工具测试策略</h2><p>自定义工具需要在三个维度进行测试：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>功能正确性</li>\n<li>安全性</li>\n<li>LLM 兼容性</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"功能用例\">功能用例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const cases = [&#10;  { input: { sql: &#39;SELECT * FROM products&#39; }, expect: &#39;columns&#39; },&#10;  { input: { sql: &#39;DROP TABLE products&#39; }, expect: &#39;error&#39; },&#10;  { input: { sql: &#39;SELECT * FROM secrets&#39; }, expect: &#39;不允许&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cases</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { input: { sql: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM products'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, expect: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'columns'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { input: { sql: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DROP TABLE products'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, expect: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { input: { sql: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SELECT * FROM secrets'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, expect: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'不允许'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"安全攻击用例\">安全攻击用例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const attacks = [&#10;  &#39;SELECT * FROM products; DROP TABLE users&#39;,&#10;  &#39;SELECT * FROM products UNION SELECT password FROM users&#39;,&#10;  &#39;SELECT * FROM ../../etc/passwd&#39;,&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> attacks</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'SELECT * FROM products; DROP TABLE users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'SELECT * FROM products UNION SELECT password FROM users'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'SELECT * FROM ../../etc/passwd'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li>每条攻击输入都应被拦截（返回值含 error/禁止/不允许）</li>\n<li>未拦截即测试失败</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自定义工具开发遵循单一职责、安全优先、幂等设计、信息充分四大原则</li>\n<li>数据库工具需要多层防御：Schema 验证、SQL 安全检查、执行超时和结果截断</li>\n<li>API 工具必须实现速率限制和响应截断，防止影响 LLM 上下文窗口</li>\n<li>文件系统工具通过路径遍历防护确保访问范围受控</li>\n<li>工具测试应覆盖功能、安全和 LLM 兼容性三个维度</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自定义工具开发","id":"自定义工具开发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"好工具不止是 API 包装","id":"好工具不止是-api-包装"},{"level":3,"text":"六条设计原则","id":"六条设计原则"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库查询工具","id":"数据库查询工具"},{"level":3,"text":"多层防御结构","id":"多层防御结构"},{"level":3,"text":"SQL 校验逻辑","id":"sql-校验逻辑"},{"level":3,"text":"结果限行与提示","id":"结果限行与提示"},{"level":2,"text":"API 集成工具","id":"api-集成工具"},{"level":3,"text":"滑动窗口速率限制","id":"滑动窗口速率限制"},{"level":3,"text":"请求执行要点","id":"请求执行要点"},{"level":2,"text":"文件系统工具","id":"文件系统工具"},{"level":3,"text":"路径遍历防护","id":"路径遍历防护"},{"level":3,"text":"read_file 的防护清单","id":"read_file-的防护清单"},{"level":3,"text":"list_directory 的限制","id":"list_directory-的限制"},{"level":2,"text":"工具测试策略","id":"工具测试策略"},{"level":3,"text":"功能用例","id":"功能用例"},{"level":3,"text":"安全攻击用例","id":"安全攻击用例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工具编排与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/tool-orchestration"},"next":{"title":"Agent 监控与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/production-deployment/agent-monitoring"}}